# Three Blind Mice: "II, III — Create a token that's a copy of target token you control." Turn 2 Bot2 bolts the Mouse token
# from chapter I, leaving Bot1 no token (Memnite is not a token). Chapters II (turn 3) and III (turn 5) have no legal target, so
# each is removed from the stack and does nothing (CR 603.3d): no copy is ever made and Bot1's permanents stay the same.
# Chapter IV (turn 7) still pumps Memnite, and the Saga is then sacrificed (CR 714.4).

